# Day 16/60 — Building Custom Claude Skills

## Objective

Learn how to create reusable AI capabilities using Claude Custom Skills.

## Task

1. Open Claude Skills
2. Create a new custom skill
3. Configure instructions and behavior
4. Test the skill on real-world examples
5. Review generated outputs
6. Compare results with normal prompting

## What I Learned

### Skills Are Reusable Prompts

Instead of copying and pasting the same instructions repeatedly, a custom skill stores expertise that can be reused whenever needed.

### Consistency Improves

The skill follows the same structure and methodology every time, producing more reliable outputs.

### AI Becomes More Specialized

By defining clear instructions, Claude can behave like a dedicated expert for a specific task.

### Workflow Efficiency Increases

A single skill can replace long prompts and save significant time during repeated tasks.

## Biggest Insight

Prompts solve individual problems.

Skills create repeatable systems.

## Key Takeaway

The future of AI productivity is not just better prompting.

It is building reusable workflows and reusable expertise.

